## 4. Architecture Comparison Matrix

| Feature | Legacy Build Pipeline | Recommended Architecture |
|---|---|---|
| **Build Configuration** | CLI flags in `build.py` (spec deleted) | Version-controlled `batmanoverlay.spec` |
| **Packaging Mode** | Mixed `--onefile` / `--onedir` assumptions | Strict **OneDir (`--onedir`)** exclusively |
| **Build Target** | Direct build into `dist/batmanoverlay/` | Stage build in `build/stage/` → Promote to `dist/` |
| **Lock Handling** | Retries on locked `dist/` | Build in `build/stage/` immune to `dist/` locks |
| **Verification** | `--version` existence check only | `--version` + 5s full application boot test |
| **`_internal/` Handling** | Copied exe away from `_internal/` | Preserves `_internal/` structure intact |

